clauses.text:
(a) facilitating the expansion of Medicaid in Missouri and Oklahoma to 
individuals below 138 percent of the Federal poverty level, which is projected 
to cover nearly half a million people;

(i) strengthening Medicaid and ACA section 1332 waiver policies to partner 
with States to develop innovative coverage options, strengthen benefits, and 
lower costs;

(a) policies or practices that make it easier for all consumers to enroll 
in and retain coverage, understand their coverage options, and select appro-
priate coverage;

